"Knowledge Base" --> "FAISS Vector DB"

[FastAPI Backend] --> [OpenAI GPT]

"FAISS Vector DB" --> [Retriever Service]

[Retriever Service] --> [FastAPI Backend]

[OpenAI GPT] --> [FastAPI Backend]

[FastAPI Backend] --> [React Frontend]

